        "original_id": "f7b72242-ac6b-57dd-b7b0-7b8cb0a00908",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dylan Everett, Dean Winchester, Hunter Brochu, Ridge Canipe, Nicolai Lawton-Giustra, Brock Kelly, Chad Everett\n- TV series: How To Be Indie, Wingin' It, Open Heart\n- Character: Dean Winchester\n- Companies: Epitome Pictures, DHX Media, marblemedia\n\nFacts:\n- Dylan Everett is best known for roles in the television series How To Be Indie from 2009 to 2011, Wingin' It from 2010 to 2013, an unnamed series from 2012 to 2013, and Open Heart in 2015.\n- Open Heart is a 2015 American-Canadian mystery-drama television series.\n- Open Heart was produced by the Epitome Pictures unit of DHX Media in association with marblemedia.\n- Other versions of the character Dean Winchester were portrayed by Hunter Brochu as a toddler, Ridge Canipe as a child, Nicolai Lawton-Giustra as a pre-teen, Brock Kelly and Dylan Everett as teens, and Chad Everett as an elderly version.",
